// uncommon and rare, CR 11–16 rare and very rare, CR 17+ very rare and legendary).
// Each band lists the items of every rarity it can give (the game picks the
// rarity first, then an item); a rarity outside the band's main pair holds only
// consumables (potions, oils, ammunition, beads, dusts) and a few lesser pieces.
// Shops sell common and uncommon things that suit them (never rare or better).
